1
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:45,590
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:46,840
[Episode 18]

3
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:47,340
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:59,090
Your mom's condition has improved a lot.

6
00:00:59,090 --> 00:00:59,960
Yes.

7
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,280
When things aren't so busy next week,

8
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,880
I'll bring her home to stay
for a couple of days.

9
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,000
And you?

10
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,530
What did the doctor say?

11
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:12,170
Probably because I've changed
my living environment.

12
00:01:12,170 --> 00:01:15,100
The doctor also said my condition
has improved a lot.

13
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:16,720
That's good.

14
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:20,960
During this time, you'll need
to buy furniture.

15
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:21,880
Don't

16
00:01:22,010 --> 00:01:23,870
go back to live at your place then.

17
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:25,240
Okay.

18
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:27,750
How much is the rent?

19
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:29,760
You—

20
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,030
Your mom's suggestion—

21
00:01:35,030 --> 00:01:37,690
are you really not going
to think about it again?

22
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:38,800
What suggestion?

23
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,280
Marriage registration.

24
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,600
She needs that peace of mind.

25
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:51,759
And you need

26
00:01:51,940 --> 00:01:54,360
a legal and social ally.

27
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:57,320
This can save you a lot of trouble

28
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:00,840
and make many things much more convenient.

29
00:02:00,910 --> 00:02:01,960
Is it only because

30
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,400
of these practical reasons?

31
00:02:14,370 --> 00:02:15,440
No.

32
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,620
Not only because of those.

33
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,520
It's also because

34
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,720
I want the person who

35
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:23,920
legitimately saves you a lot of trouble

36
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,360
to be me.

37
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,400
Not some other suitable candidate.

38
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:30,130
It can only be me.

39
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:31,800
Besides,

40
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:33,520
in practical terms,

41
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,720
if one day we separate,

42
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:38,100
you can take half of my assets.

43
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,680
No one would turn down money, right?

44
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,400
Are you sure

45
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:46,020
you want to talk about this with a lawyer?

46
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:48,620
But then again,

47
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,200
you rich people have plenty of tricks.

48
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:52,240
Never mind.

49
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,770
If one day something happens to me,

50
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:57,890
you'll be alone—

51
00:02:58,079 --> 00:03:00,080
rich, free, and a widow.

52
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:03,280
-No one will refuse such a happy life.
-Zhuo Yu'an.

53
00:03:04,410 --> 00:03:06,610
I don't like this kind of hypothetical.

54
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:13,810
Okay.

55
00:03:14,950 --> 00:03:16,280
Then I won't say it.

56
00:03:23,450 --> 00:03:24,480
What I mean is,

57
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,200
you have the right to choose.

58
00:03:28,380 --> 00:03:30,440
Those are all things I can guarantee.

59
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,920
Do we have to go now?

60
00:03:46,170 --> 00:03:48,829
I didn't bring my household
registration book.

61
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,430
Now, for marriage registration,

62
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:53,630
you don't need the household
registration book anymore.

63
00:04:09,370 --> 00:04:12,440
[Certificate Holder: Zhuo Yu'an][Name:
Zhuo Yu'an] [Name: Shu Tinglan]

64
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:12,640
Congratulations to you
both on your marriage.

65
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:19,339
[Civil Affairs Bureau Marriage Registration Office of Senzhou City]

66
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:19,560
So serious.

67
00:04:19,410 --> 00:04:21,709
[Certificate Holder: Zhuo Yu'an]
[Name: Zhuo Yu'an]

68
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,130
What are you looking at?

69
00:04:22,190 --> 00:04:24,280
I shouldn't have stayed up late
last night.

70
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:26,080
I don’t look good enough in the shots.

71
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:28,600
It makes me feel like I’m not
good enough for you.

72
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,200
No time to joke with you.

73
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,940
My leave time is almost up.

74
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:33,770
I'm about to be late.

75
00:04:35,030 --> 00:04:37,390
Then I shell not disturb your
Great Lawyer Shu's work.

76
00:04:37,390 --> 00:04:38,680
I'll keep the certificate for now.

77
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,580
Remember to eat breakfast.

78
00:04:39,580 --> 00:04:40,159
Okay.

79
00:04:40,610 --> 00:04:45,210
[Civil Affairs Bureau Marriage Registration Office of Senzhou City]

80
00:04:45,230 --> 00:04:47,090
[Certificate Holder: Zhuo Yu'an]
[Name: Zhuo Yu'an]

81
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,370
Date of birth: November 7, 1993

82
00:04:59,770 --> 00:05:00,920
Everything's done?

83
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:02,050
Back so soon?

84
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:02,720
Yep.

85
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,200
What big matter

86
00:05:06,290 --> 00:05:07,880
was worth our Lawyer Shu

87
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,960
taking a full two hours of leave?

88
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,320
Could be big, could be small.

89
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,560
Are you busy?

90
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:26,030
[Are you busy?]

91
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:34,630
[Are you busy?]

92
00:05:34,659 --> 00:05:38,310
♪ Waiting for you in the crowd ♪

93
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:36,740
Missing me right after we parted?

94
00:05:39,380 --> 00:05:45,090
♪ Hearts in sync—how incredible ♪

95
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:43,320
Why did you decide to marry me?

96
00:05:46,140 --> 00:05:50,740
♪ It's the cloak of a close embrace ♪

97
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,370
It has legal effect now.

98
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:51,080
You can't take it back.

99
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:56,670
♪ It's the steadfast days and
nights we share ♪

100
00:05:53,050 --> 00:05:54,800
Be serious.

101
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:57,440
Shu Tinglan.

102
00:05:57,830 --> 00:05:59,280
It was because I love you.

103
00:05:57,870 --> 00:06:02,980
♪ When we weather the storm together,
don't forget ♪

104
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,640
Why don't you reply?

105
00:06:03,650 --> 00:06:08,270
♪ Breathing in the long river of time ♪

106
00:06:04,690 --> 00:06:06,680
Can’t you just cheer me up?

107
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:08,280
It's okay.

108
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:10,440
Even if you don't cheer me up, I love you.

109
00:06:09,010 --> 00:06:14,340
♪ My only promise is to you ♪

110
00:06:13,730 --> 00:06:15,080
Love you.

111
00:06:16,490 --> 00:06:19,270
♪ Between us ♪

112
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,040
Don't work late tonight.

113
00:06:19,530 --> 00:06:22,530
♪ Suspicion feels so far away ♪

114
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:22,720
I'll pick you up

115
00:06:22,890 --> 00:06:28,300
♪ When our eyes meet,
I feel your burning gaze ♪

116
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:31,660
♪ The wind by the shore has stilled ♪

117
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:34,710
♪ And you're smiling too ♪

118
00:06:35,060 --> 00:06:37,290
♪ Make a wish to the wind ♪

119
00:06:37,810 --> 00:06:40,670
♪ It's Cupid's arrow,
set loose from the string ♪

120
00:06:40,990 --> 00:06:42,790
What did you want to see me about?

121
00:06:44,020 --> 00:06:45,930
Where are you in the work handover?

122
00:06:45,930 --> 00:06:47,170
How much longer until you go abroad?

123
00:06:47,170 --> 00:06:48,790
You have no right to interfere
with my freedom.

124
00:06:48,790 --> 00:06:49,760
Zhuo Yu'an.

125
00:06:50,140 --> 00:06:51,190
I thought you were someone

126
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:53,250
who could stay rational at all times,

127
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,450
who wouldn't let personal feelings

128
00:06:54,450 --> 00:06:55,720
affect your work.

129
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:57,440
But now?

130
00:06:57,780 --> 00:06:59,830
You're marginalizing me
within the company.

131
00:06:59,830 --> 00:07:01,060
And transferring me to headquarters,

132
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:02,160
never to return.

133
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,360
All because of what happened

134
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,290
between me and Shu Tinglan. Right?

135
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:09,640
First,

136
00:07:10,650 --> 00:07:12,240
I am a person with feelings.

137
00:07:13,010 --> 00:07:14,160
I can't stay rational

138
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,080
at all times.

139
00:07:15,530 --> 00:07:16,360
Second,

140
00:07:17,790 --> 00:07:18,790
transferring you

141
00:07:18,830 --> 00:07:20,690
is an internal company decision.

142
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:22,010
It has nothing to do with
outside personnel.

143
00:07:22,010 --> 00:07:22,800
But I'm human too.

144
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,960
I'm not a tool.

145
00:07:25,150 --> 00:07:26,840
Zhuo Yu'an, doing this now—

146
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:29,040
do you care even a tiny bit

147
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,960
about our friendship?

148
00:07:31,610 --> 00:07:33,670
If I didn't care about our friendship,

149
00:07:33,670 --> 00:07:34,680
Wen Jian,

150
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:36,000
you wouldn't be

151
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,200
standing here.

152
00:07:37,760 --> 00:07:38,770
You'd be in prison.

153
00:07:38,770 --> 00:07:39,760
Or in court.

154
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:43,040
I don't know what you're talking about.

155
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,650
What more do you want to understand?

156
00:07:44,650 --> 00:07:45,640
What did you install

157
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:47,970
in the smart system at Shu Tinglan's home?

158
00:07:49,050 --> 00:07:50,000
Do you know

159
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:52,420
what tampering with user data

160
00:07:52,510 --> 00:07:54,650
and secretly designing a hypnosis system

161
00:07:54,650 --> 00:07:56,350
means for the company?

162
00:07:56,380 --> 00:07:57,480
I didn't do it.

163
00:07:58,820 --> 00:07:59,720
Wen Jian.

164
00:08:00,620 --> 00:08:01,660
We studied together.

165
00:08:01,660 --> 00:08:03,520
We've worked together until now.

166
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:06,220
Do you think I don't know
your professional habits?

167
00:08:06,220 --> 00:08:07,170
You can fool others.

168
00:08:07,170 --> 00:08:08,570
You think you can fool me?

169
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:12,040
It's precisely because I care
about our friendship

170
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,840
that I covered this up for you.

171
00:08:16,490 --> 00:08:17,400
In short,

172
00:08:18,550 --> 00:08:19,490
you absolutely cannot continue

173
00:08:19,490 --> 00:08:21,220
managing the tech department.

174
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:22,680
I'll give you 3 days.

175
00:08:23,890 --> 00:08:24,800
Otherwise,

176
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:28,700
leave Zhuoyuan Technology forever.

177
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:30,730
You think doing all this for Shu Tinglan

178
00:08:30,730 --> 00:08:32,100
makes you deeply devoted?

179
00:08:32,100 --> 00:08:33,039
Zhuo Yu'an.

180
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,159
No.

181
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:38,960
Even if Shu Tinglan really got hurt,

182
00:08:38,980 --> 00:08:41,640
you wouldn't make this public.

183
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:44,000
You don't dare tell her the truth.

184
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:46,080
And you won't punish me for it.

185
00:08:47,150 --> 00:08:48,640
Because in your heart,

186
00:08:49,290 --> 00:08:51,360
whether it's Shu Tinglan or me,

187
00:08:51,490 --> 00:08:53,280
neither compares to your
Zhuoyuan Technology.

188
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,880
Your work is more important.

189
00:08:56,370 --> 00:08:58,000
So admit it, Zhuo Yu'an.

190
00:08:59,210 --> 00:09:01,440
Your feelings for her are just so-so.

191
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:06,290
You think you two will really
end up together?

192
00:09:07,230 --> 00:09:08,240
No.

193
00:09:09,540 --> 00:09:10,480
The Zhuo family

194
00:09:11,510 --> 00:09:13,240
will never accept her.

195
00:09:23,650 --> 00:09:24,640
The Zhuo family

196
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:30,120
will never accept Shu Minghai's daughter.

197
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,000
From now on,

198
00:09:55,190 --> 00:09:57,260
don't park the car somewhere so obvious.

199
00:09:57,260 --> 00:09:59,060
It's not good if colleagues see.

200
00:10:02,370 --> 00:10:03,880
Happy newlywed.

201
00:10:05,540 --> 00:10:06,230
Thanks.

202
00:10:06,250 --> 00:10:07,000
Same to you.

203
00:10:11,870 --> 00:10:13,110
What's this?

204
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:14,080
Don't move.

205
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,550
What is it?

206
00:10:18,580 --> 00:10:20,120
So mysterious.

207
00:10:20,250 --> 00:10:20,720
This—

208
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:23,360
is a wedding gift from our mom.

209
00:10:24,530 --> 00:10:25,680
My mom?

210
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,420
Our mom is so good to me.

211
00:10:28,730 --> 00:10:30,040
Then why can't I see it?

212
00:10:30,590 --> 00:10:31,480
It's a secret.

213
00:10:34,090 --> 00:10:34,640
Okay.

214
00:10:35,210 --> 00:10:36,610
So where are we going now?

215
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,760
Also a secret.

216
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,120
Aren't we just going home?

217
00:10:57,070 --> 00:10:59,600
Give my little moment of ritual
some respect.

218
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:07,400
Welcome home.

219
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:08,840
Mrs. Zhuo.

220
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:26,930
Happy newlywed.

221
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,080
Mrs. Zhuo.

222
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,410
Happy newlywed.

223
00:11:44,230 --> 00:11:45,920
You prepared all this?

224
00:11:46,410 --> 00:11:47,480
Yes.

225
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:51,280
Didn't expect

226
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,520
you've got this move.

227
00:11:53,540 --> 00:11:54,760
You don't like it?

228
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:57,560
It's okay.

229
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,080
A bit cheesy.

230
00:12:28,090 --> 00:12:29,000
Give me your hand.
